Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|cmis.repository.type|sharepoint2010|
		|custom.properties|session.store.password=true${line.separator}company.security.auth.type=screenName${line.separator}default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|osgi.app.includes|sharepoint|
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|test.run.environment|EE|
		|testray.main.component.name|Documents Management|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When these variables
		|sharepointVMHostName|TestPropsUtil#get('cmis.repository.vm.host.name')|
	And AntCommand the value 'clean-sharepoint-repository -Dssh.host=${sharepointVMHostName}' at locator 'build-test-sharepoint.xml'
	And User login PG
		|authenticationMethod|By Screen Name|
		|userScreenName|test|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|Account Settings|
	And User edit Details Via My Account
		|userScreenNameEdit|administrator|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|Account Settings|
	And User edit Password Via My Account
		|currentPassword|test|
		|newPassword|password|
	And User logout PG
	And User login PG
		|authenticationMethod|By Screen Name|
		|password|password|
		|userScreenName|administrator|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Documents and Media|
	And DMNavigator goto Add Repository PG
	And DMRepository edit
		|dmRepositoryName|Sharepoint Repository Name|
	And DMRepository add Sharepoint
		|dmRepositoryLibraryName|Documents|
		|dmRepositorySiteURL|http://${sharepointVMHostName}|
	And PortletEntry save
	And DMDocument enable Actions Menu On Portlet
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	Then DMPortlet set Descriptive View

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|

Scenario: View Document As Guest
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	When DMNavigator goto Repository
		|dmRepositoryName|Sharepoint Repository Name|
	And DMDocument add PG
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_1.doc|
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_1.doc|
	And DMDocument view PG
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_1.doc|
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_1.doc|
		|dmRepositoryName|true|
	And User logout PG
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Documents and Media Page|
	And DMPortlet set Descriptive View
	And DMNavigator goto Repository
		|dmRepositoryName|Sharepoint Repository Name|
	And DMDocument view PG
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_1.doc|
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_1.doc|
		|dmRepositoryName|true|
	Then User login PG
		|authenticationMethod|By Screen Name|
		|password|password|
		|userScreenName|administrator|